    "body": "The project-owned package caused the reported Story-start crash. The loader log ends immediately after loading its cameras.ymt, before GameplayTweaks ScriptMain begins. Cause: I treated OpenIV export XML with root UNK_TYPE_0x6172064B as a load-ready LML cameras.ymt; the loadable format uses root 0x6172064B. I moved only GameplayTweaks Horse Camera out of LML to recoverable mod storage. I did not restore the third-party mod. Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#146 is actionable again until the project generator produces and validates a loadable data file.",
